  "deliverables": [
    "仅用apply_patch实现：Tcl在create_clock/link后、complete marker前生成opensta-bpu-negative-slack.tsv与opensta-bpu-update-fanout.tsv；前者包含schema/header、matched_pin_count/numeric_slack_pin_count/negative_slack_pin_count及每个唯一negative pin的full_name/slack，允许negative count=0但matched/numeric必须非0；后者对匹配OooBranchLocalPht wrapper/bank update_taken_i的每个source列出唯一full_name、endpoint_count与所有flat sequential endpoint full_name，匹配为空即STA失败。parser严格校验计数、唯一性、finite negative值、source/endpoint行一致，要求至少一个wrapper source且最大endpoint_count<=16，并拒绝任何public source直接到local-PHT valid_q/counter_q entry D；summary写入带artifact SHA的bpu_negative_slack_inventory和bpu_update_fanout_inventory，明确这是complete pin/endpoints inventory而非所有unique path枚举。runner末端binding继续消费带新字段summary，production manifest自动绑定变更Tcl/parser/runner。新增定向unittest覆盖正向0/多negative、计数/重复/非负行、missing wrapper、>16 fanout、direct counter endpoint、artifact缺失、parser/runner绕过；静态自审后只执行一次新tool+architecture_registry unittest、一次bash -n runner、一次scoped diff check，产物写新证据目录。不运行生产OpenSTA/综合/STA。"
